# data-flow

## Core Pattern Processing Pipeline

### Pattern Ingestion Flow
File: src/api/server.cpp
- Raw patterns enter through /api/v1/pattern endpoint
- Patterns undergo coherence validation
- Valid patterns enter memory tier system based on coherence scores

### Memory Tier Transitions 
Files: src/memory/memory_tier_manager.cpp, src/memory/memory_tier.cpp
- Patterns flow between three memory tiers (STM -> MTM -> LTM)
- Promotion criteria:
  - STM -> MTM: coherence > 0.7, stability > 0.7, generation > 5
  - MTM -> LTM: coherence > 0.9, stability > 0.85, generation > 100
- Demotion occurs when coherence drops below 0.3

### Quantum State Transformations
File: src/quantum/processor.cpp
- Quantum patterns undergo state evolution through QFH processor
- Coherence changes trigger pattern migrations between tiers
- State collapse detection prompts pattern demotion
- Entanglement detection influences pattern relationships

### System Integration Points
Files: src/api/sep_engine.cpp, src/api/bridge.cpp
- Pattern data flows from API layer to quantum processor
- Memory tier state synchronizes with persistence layer
- Pattern relationships propagate through quantum bridge
- Context blending occurs at API integration boundary

### Pattern Evolution Pipeline
Files: src/quantum/evolution.cpp, src/quantum/pattern_evolution.cpp
- Patterns evolve through quantum manifold transformations
- Evolution results trigger memory tier transitions
- Pattern stability influences evolution pathways
- Parent-child relationships form based on evolution results

